# HCal SiPM bias: INIT (DACs to 0, 4.096 V ref) then all 16 SiPM ports to 3600, boards 0, 2, 3
# HV supply at 48 V; DACs reset at every LV cycle, so rerun after power-up
BIAS
INIT
0
SET_SIPM
0
-1
3600
INIT
2
SET_SIPM
2
-1
3600
INIT
3
SET_SIPM
3
-1
3600
READ_SIPM
0
-1
READ_SIPM
2
-1
READ_SIPM
3
-1
EXIT
EXIT
